Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:05.12,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:08.79,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
