Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:30.74,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760,460)}Syncing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000\N\N{\fs}Sync-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:38.45,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:34.34,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,430)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:38.45,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790,480)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:45.96,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:43.68,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,492)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
