Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:54.00,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:58.62,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:02.46,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.83,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:09.85,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.37,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:13.58,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.04,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.89,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:20.48,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:24.72,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:31.13,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:35.35,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:39.63,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.72,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:48.27,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:51.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.82,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:59.77,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:03.45,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:06.73,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:10.90,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.25,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
